5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure the human element is secure. I shall look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about the actual purchasing power of the award. I will check travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the shared tools are actually working! I'll check incident logs on shared instrumentation and accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we identify where delays occur. I'll examine station records from partner field sites and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Instinct is unreliable. I will review closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
